## Troubleshooting

### Common Issues
```bash
# If Ollama not responding
sudo systemctl restart ollama  # Linux
# or restart Docker container
docker-compose restart ollama

# If Qdrant connection fails
docker-compose logs qdrant
docker-compose restart qdrant

# If models not found (model names from project-fundamentals)
ollama pull gpt-oss:20b  # From project-fundamentals
ollama pull embeddinggemma:latest  # From project-fundamentals

# Check available models
ollama list
```

### Service Verification
```python
# Python code to verify services
import requests

# Test Ollama (URL from project-fundamentals)
try:
    response = requests.get('http://localhost:11434/api/tags')  # From project-fundamentals
    print(f"Ollama status: {response.status_code}")
except:
    print("Ollama not accessible")

# Test Qdrant (URL from project-fundamentals)
try:
    response = requests.get('http://localhost:6333/collections')  # From project-fundamentals
    print(f"Qdrant status: {response.status_code}")
except:
    print("Qdrant not accessible")
```

## File Operations

### Adding New Documents
```python
# Process new PDFs
from langchain_community.document_loaders import DirectoryLoader, PyMuPDFLoader

# Load new documents (patterns from project-fundamentals)
loader = DirectoryLoader("data", glob="**/*.pdf", loader_cls=PyMuPDFLoader)  # From project-fundamentals
new_documents = loader.load()

# Chunk and add to vector store
chunks = text_splitter.split_documents(new_documents)
vector_store.add_documents(documents=chunks)
```

